// session-progress-run.bml — the progression across every measured session, read from the ledger and nothing else:
// day by day, then the earlier half of the sessions against the later (rented requests, output, cache read; local tokens
// generated; the local share in parts per million). It measures nothing and writes nothing; observe/session-rent-run.bml
// is the door that fills the ledger. Run from the repo root.
// preludes: form-stdlib/bml/session-progress.bml
section [form.bml] {
    sp-print(sp-progress-lines());
}
